{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve the history event subtype before deriving payload identity.** The synthesized `Operation` objects never copy `Event.subType()`, so this condition is always false. Offloaded wait-for-condition state is consequently loaded as `RESULT` instead of `STATE`, producing the wrong entity ID and failing filesystem ownership validation. Carry subtype metadata into reconstructed operations and add wait-for-condition cloud-history coverage.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7odJik","finding_digest":"05565d6d192599625c09da3e574163450bf3d1573b91c67cdd740a6b0dcf4e7f","finding_id":"arf_v1_avlf23izewmwexaj3i7foqldiu","finding_key":"sdk-testing/historyeventprocessor::resolveoperationpayload::wait-for-condition-subtype-preservation","identity_key":"sdk-testing/historyeventprocessor::resolveoperationpayload::wait-for-condition-subtype-preservation","line":285,"observation_digest":"b5bfbb500d2e8128551f640811b4055642aab7478b1bb26945bb39ed7156ae0c","observation_id":"aro_v1_ww73wuanf2asqvi7mqebdnafkz","path":"sdk-testing/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/testing/cloud/HistoryEventProcessor.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T01:31:57Z","review_id":"arr_v1_vlvjn3k2bg6cxoepbwrwc2slgw","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"88bc34d2d082149d899d22adc7327b4f4d12ef4c","reviewer":"codex","start_line":283,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_k3mjuusc63lctmcm7pbittio6u","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T01:31:57Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
